DASH.glossary.hl={m:"Breadth",d:"New highs = NYSE stocks at a 52-week high; new lows = at a 52-week low. Index up while lows outnumber highs = a narrow bounce. Latest session (Mon 26 Oct): 58 highs vs 158 lows even as the S&P rose 0.7%. That is a narrow, AI-led bounce: lows eased from Friday's 171, but highs did not recover. Watch whether highs pick up after the Fed and Big Tech earnings."};
